Ket luan packet `HR-001` duoc danh gia `retract`: route nay reachable va dataflow co that, nhung packet-local evidence cho thay day la public OptInMonster signup surface co chu dich, khong phai BAC. Toi da bound impact ve trang thai “chi co tac dung tren site da connect Reach” va ghi ro nhung bang chung con thieu neu muon mo lai finding. JSON da parse thanh cong bang `jq`.
